obj/
bin/
*.user
.vs/
# docs/ stays local (design docs are working notes), EXCEPT the shader sources — the .fx files are
# real source, and only their compiled .xnb output was being tracked. Git can't re-include a path
# under an excluded directory, so each level is opened up explicitly before narrowing again.
docs/*
!docs/Shaders/
docs/Shaders/*
!docs/Shaders/*.fx
